  -> dovetailing: end/cum grows like 4^j/j^3 (not polynomial in cum); the wrapper that runs f on powers of 2
     only: end/cum <= ~1.2.  'A^C_f is not cheap to enumerate' is a property of the dovetailing enumerator, not
     of the set A^C_f, for the notes' own example.
